{"title":"IQOS Iluma \u0026 Kits","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop authentic IQOS devices exclusively at [YOUR DOMAIN]. Explore a wide range of HEETS, TEREA, and Fiit sticks at the best prices online!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"iqos-2-4-plus-starter-kit","title":"IQOS 2.4 Plus Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS 2.4 Plus Kit, which includes an IQOS Holder and all the tools you need to clean and charge your IQOS. Introducing IQOS Kenya Marlboro Cigarette in Kenya. Buy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos kenya\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e in Kenya at best prices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note: IQOS 2.4 plus starter kit doesn't include heets in box. You have to purchase heets separately, \u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos heets Kenya\"\u003eclick here\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"heets\"\u003eto\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"heets Kenya\"\u003ebuy heets\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41574754156599,"sku":"5","price":8500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-2.4-plus-group-with-4-new-heets-WHITE.jpg?v=1743120604"},{"product_id":"iqos-3-starter-kit","title":"IQOS 3 Duo Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS 3 Starter Kit uses the latest technology – a heating element made of gold and platinum and coated with ceramics to control the heating temperature. Introducing IQOS Kenya Marlboro Cigarette in Kenya. Buy \u003ca title=\"Iqos kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e in Kenya at best prices.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIQOS 3 Duo kit is compatible with Heets Classic, Heets Fiit and Heets Dimensions. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-3-DUO-infographic.jpg?v=1756885422\" alt=\"iqos 3 duo infographic\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note: IQOS 3 Duo starter kit doesn't include heets in box. You have to purchase heets separately, \u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Iqos heets Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003eclick here\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca title=\"heets\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003eto\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca title=\"heets Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\"\u003ebuy heets\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652548272183,"sku":"IQOS 3 Starter Kit","price":9950.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-3-Starter-Kit.jpg?v=1756885548"},{"product_id":"iqos-4-0-iluma-starter-kit","title":"IQOS 4.0 Iluma Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS ILUMA line is the so-called Iqos 4.0 - the fourth generation of the most popular heat-not-burn devices in the world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma, takes the appeal of heat-not-burn tobacco to a new level with the new technology Smart Core Induction System™, maintaining the original IQOS technology that heats tobacco leaves directly from the inside.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma has familiar design, which can be said to be a standard model of IQOS, but has been evolved. We have achieved a simple feel that fits comfortably in your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDevice can be used two times continuously. It also has an auto start function that automatically starts heating.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIMPORTANT NOTE:\u003c\/strong\u003e IQOS ILUMA is designed to be used only with TEREA heating tobacco units. Do not use IQOS ILUMA and TEREA heating tobacco units with older generations of IQOS, as you may damage your device.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma is designed for use with Smart Core Stick™ only. Do not use IQOS Iluma and Smart Core Stick™ with traditional IQOS devices (IQOS 3 Duo and earlier models) and their dedicated tobacco sticks. This can damage the device. Shop Iqos \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673628778551,"sku":"Iluma 4.0 Starter Kit","price":18000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-starter-kit.jpg?v=1747872110"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition","title":"IQOS Iluma - Oasis Limited Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the exclusive IQOS LUMA OASIS, a stylish and unique addition to the IQOS family. This sleek gadget will be the perfect choice for those who want to quit conventional cigarettes and switch to a healthier alternative. Thanks to the advanced SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM tobacco heating technology, you will get the most comfortable and clean use without ash and odor. The amount of contamination is minimized, so you no longer have to spend time cleaning the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe design of OASIS is simply stunning. It is made in bright and saturated colors that will take you to a world of amazing landscapes and adventures. This limited edition will be a great addition to your look and will make you stand out from the crowd.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJoin the millions of IQOS users around the world and start enjoying all the benefits of heated tobacco. Despite the limited edition, you still have the opportunity to own this stylish and functional device. Don't miss your chance!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDevice Colour: OASIS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNumber of sessions with one full charge: 20 sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 135 min\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHolder dimension \u0026amp; weight:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight - 101.mm, Diameter - 14.5 mm, Weight - 30.5grm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePocket charger dimension and weight:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight - 117.2mm, Width — 44.7mm, Weight - 141grm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging port: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery capacity: 2380mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating temperature: 0°C ~ 40°C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Connectivity: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDevice Compatible with: TEREA sticks\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 2h 15m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating temperature: 350 °C (660 °F)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating method: Smartcore induction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating time: 15 sec\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSession length: up to 6 minutes \/ 14 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41710201897015,"sku":"Iluma - Oasis Ltd Edition","price":19990.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-oasis-limited-edition.jpg?v=1750038453"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-i-standard-blue-breeze","title":"IQOS Iluma i Standard - Blue Breeze","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma I Standard Breeze Blue tobacco heater has a familiar design and functionality and has been brought to perfection. In addition to induction contactless heating of tobacco and cleanliness when smoking, this device has several improvements. It makes it a bestseller in the ash-free smoking market. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma I Standard Breeze Blue has a touch screen with clear indications. This makes the device look stylish and perform a practical role. With one light push, the e-cigarette goes into pause mode. You can return to the session in a couple of minutes. On the screen, you can see how many sessions you can smoke in a row at the moment — 1 or 2. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe indication also displays the state of tobacco heating. Select the economical consumption mode to charge the battery less often or the maximum performance mode to smoke two sessions in a row and make the most puffs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma I Standard (Breeze Blue) Specifications:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe heater body is made of aluminum.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColor: Breeze blue.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe heating temperature is 350 degrees.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating type: induction.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 5.9 x 8.8 x 15.4 cm; 0.1 g.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe battery capacity of the device is 2900 mAh.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFull charge time of the case is 135 minutes.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay with indication and control.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePause during the session.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode that adds more puffs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEconomy mode.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility with sticks: Terea Iluma.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41710214119479,"sku":"Iluma i Standard - Blue Breeze","price":19000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Iluma-i-Standard-Blue-Breeze.jpg?v=1750039282"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-one-kit","title":"IQOS Iluma One Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe IQOS ILUMA ONE takes tobacco heating to the next level. A stylish, compact and portable device using the beloved IQOS technology that has 20 consecutive uses per charge. Its convenient all in one design requires no cleaning and is excellent for everyday usage, no matter where you are.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll-in-one design, offering up to 20 consecutive uses with a single charge. Next level tobacco experience without blades.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis IQOS device is ONLY compatible with IQOS Terea Sticks\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact all in one device.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM™ technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 20 consecutive uses with a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy insertion and extraction of the stick\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRapid charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo cleaning ever\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomisation options with accessories\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy switch to IQOS ILUMA ONE?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReal Tobacco taste: IQOS ILUMA is specially designed to be used with real tobacco sticks. TEREA sticks provide real tobacco taste \u0026amp; satisfaction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHarm Reduction: Switching completely to IQOS presents less risk to your health than continuing to smoke. IQOS emits 95% lower levels of harmful chemicals compared to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: Compatible only with Terea Sticks.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41712608018487,"sku":"Iluma One Kit","price":15000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-one-pebble-beige.jpg?v=1750126480"},{"product_id":"iqos-lil-solid-2-0","title":"IQOS Lil Solid 2.0","description":"\u003cp\u003eEasy to use all-in-one device, with 25 sessions on one full charge, and the time of each session is increased to about 5 minutes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS introduces Lil Solid 2.0 to bring a smoke-free future even closer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImagine a world where everything is simple, easy and convenient. A world where there is nothing superfluous, but the most important thing remains. A world of enjoying the taste of real tobacco, but without smoke and ash.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe tobacco in \u003ca title=\"Iqos devices\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-iluma\"\u003eIQOS device\u003c\/a\u003e Lil Solid 2.0 heats up rather than burns, so there is no fire or ash during use. This means that there is no risk of burning your clothes or furniture, and you do not risk damaging the carpet or upholstery in the car by falling ash.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso when using Lil Solid 2.0, tobacco vapor (aerosol) is emitted, so there is no smell of cigarette smoke.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReleased: 2021\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDevice type: All-in-one\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufacturer: KT\u0026amp;G, introduced by PMI\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging port type: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 106 ? 31 ? 22 mm \/ 4.17 x 1.22 x 0.87 in\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 99 g \/ 3.5 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery capacity: 2950 mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsecutive uses: 3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUses per full charge: 25\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 2 h\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating temperature: 350 °C (660 °F)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating method: Heating pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeating time: 25 sec\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible Sticks type: \u003ca title=\"Fiit cigarettes\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-fiit\"\u003eFiit cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e, \u0026amp; \u003ca title=\"Heets cigarettes\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/heets-cigarette\"\u003eHeets cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSession length: 5 minutes or 14 puff\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41807728967735,"sku":"Lil Solid 2.0","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/lil-solid-20-stone-grey-super-shipping-2.webp?v=1754265999"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-prime-i","title":"IQOS Iluma i Prime","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma i Series - Up to three experiences instead of two on each charge, better battery management, pause function.\u003cbr\u003ePhilip Morris International has launched IQOS Iluma i, the latest and most innovative addition to its growing portfolio of smoke-free products, in Kenya. IQOS Iluma disrupted the category by introducing induction-heating technology that heats tobacco from within, to provide a consistent taste experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, IQOS to new heights, with the launch of IQOS Iluma i—the latest innovation in our smoke-free portfolio, offering a range of advanced features for a clean, seamless, and more flexible experience. The new touch screen on the device’s holder allows users to see experience-relevant information quickly and easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new IQOS Iluma i also includes smart features that help prolong the lifespan of the holder’s battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy IQOS Iluma i Prime Series online at best price in Kenya.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: All orders for this product will be accepted on partial payment basis only.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42006272475191,"sku":"Iluma i Prime","price":19999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Iqos-Iluma-i-Prime.webp?v=1764630311"},{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-i-one-kit","title":"IQOS Iluma i One Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIQOS ILUMA\u003c\/strong\u003e i is the newest generation of tobacco heating devices in the IQOS ILUMA lineup — no ash, no smoke, and no lingering cigarette smell.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eIQOS ILUMA i ONE\u003c\/strong\u003e features a compact, user-friendly design with a sleek aluminum finish that feels smooth and comfortable in hand.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith intelligent functions like Auto-Start and FlexPuff, it offers an intuitive and effortless tobacco heating experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy an easier draw*, blade-free technology, and no cleaning needed — consistent with all devices in the IQOS ILUMA series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eILUMA i ONE device\u003cbr\u003ePower Adapter \u0026amp; Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*TEREA tobacco sticks are not included.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSuitable for TEREA and DELIA sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42114937618487,"sku":"Iluma i One Kit","price":16500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Buy-iQOS-iLUMA-i-ONE-Breeze-Blue.png?v=1771556474"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-iluma.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}





